{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "d1d748b19bc903d2bd552fe1d013e00cf62c677b1cc652dcd0a1742c76ef8fd1", "ja": "きっと、同じ気持ち", "zh": "一定怀着同样的心情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "278edf4216af9bc9aad4f01e0d1e93f920096bbb75ef255f14366dd59e60fe07", "ja": "握手会当日、真っ白な顔のファンがやって\nくるが、美奈子は真摯に対応。自分達と\n同じく緊張しているなら……そう思って行動\nしたと語る美奈子に、プロデューサーは\n勉強させてもらったと返すのだった。", "zh": "握手会当天，一位脸色苍白的粉丝来到现场，美奈子认真地应对。\n她说，想着对方如果也和自己一样紧张……便采取了行动。\n制作人回答说，自己受教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "76eb387546363b63533c425cfde0a1fd182914cc8d671da47cf4369d493a3b7b", "ja": "インストアライブ　特典サイン＆握手会　当日……", "zh": "店内演唱会　特典签名&握手会　当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "9fb3cb4bc4383f84141837a06501e78f00fdcaed496403e8c8672afe2dcba968", "ja": "それでは、整理券50番から60番の方、\n前に移動してくださーい。", "zh": "那么，请整理券50号至60号的各位往前移动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "fb5fe169c5bfb5f92623e31633788983718dc03bb8eddaf3fc0808ad1541e996", "ja": "こんにちは！　今日はありがとうございます♪\nえっ、デビューライブを見て、来てくれたんですか？", "zh": "您好！今天谢谢您能来♪\n咦，您是看了出道演唱会后特意来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "3faa30ef817a273096b0c5e5ad8a6e32afae1d9d1fa08229924e69cae800b5e0", "ja": "今日のライブはどうでした？　……わぁ、よかった！\nこれからも頑張りますので、また来てくださいね♪", "zh": "今天的演出感觉怎么样？……哇，太好了！\n今后我也会继续努力的，请再来参加哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "dcb21555596b9c238958f785f18a1b3a1b9211c0827f3c3f80c01a894db485c3", "ja": "（初めてのファン交流イベントだけど、トラブルも\nないし、順調だな。この調子なら……）", "zh": "（虽然是第一次举办粉丝交流活动，但没有发生什么麻烦，进展得很顺利。照这样下去的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1005_staff", "source_sha256": "b483a1d75f3581567da85605f2d2bd0ebae19363bdf20a1f6884e3d1f0930825", "ja": "続いて、51番の方～。", "zh": "接下来是51号～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "f265fa4aed00aa834cfdd61caf45a128de25f2eee5c11875e0b720071c247d76", "ja": "こんにちは、佐竹美奈子です！\n今日はありがとうござい、ます……。？", "zh": "你好，我是佐竹美奈子！\n今天谢谢你……。？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1007_fun", "source_sha256": "7b53a993ea19dad3b3d779e33eb2cb4efda41dd0a3ab3210fbb265d26ff9c513", "ja": "あ、あの……。", "zh": "啊，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "1cb61c99ab32411c84913728a97bd47fbb7e4b9b559f002a5afa6d2f54707655", "ja": "えっと、どうかしましたか？\nなんだか、お顔が真っ白ですけど……。", "zh": "那个，请问您怎么了？\n您的脸色好像变得煞白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1009_ganmensohakufun", "source_sha256": "df0025a13c5b4a1a2cd9f159bbaa879652e64b934750d7d5e059afb60bc3057d", "ja": "いえ、あの……あのっ……。", "zh": "不，那个……那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "b29b4ae32b551f6c11880a60f531ffae070c65ca0baab6f071266181d3ed4226", "ja": "！　……あの、お客様？　なにか……。", "zh": "啊……那位客人？有什么事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "a1f66ac01876a1de1c07991c46c9169be35dcc466281228229f4b4f8d9e9849e", "ja": "プロデューサーさん……。\nあっ、そっか。大丈夫、大丈夫ですよ！", "zh": "制作人……。\n啊，对了。没事，没事的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "092a857edf5966cff915f795d264ff0e67fe3add70d349084599245b788ac6ab", "ja": "美奈子……。", "zh": "美奈子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "20c8c7806663174ad87907350d78ad750b58d3dde61d516bdf1c73a5b6b24163", "ja": "そうだ、一緒に深呼吸しませんか？\nじつは私も、すっごく緊張しちゃってて。えへへっ♪", "zh": "对了，要不要一起做深呼吸？\n其实我也特别紧张呢。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "77d75bd512809dcf9bda97cb7d2a03a376ebd781ad1002bbfde7087a98861c50", "ja": "それじゃ、いきますよ？　大きく吸って～、吐いて～。\nそうそう、いい感じですね！", "zh": "那么，要开始咯？深深地吸气～，呼气～。\n对对，就是这样，很不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "fe93278a725b5d95ee96678e4423bfbf1fbfe3076a709f1985ce1503d3659a87", "ja": "ゆっくりで大丈夫ですよ。時間もたっぷりありますから\n……なにしろ私たち、まだ新人なもので。ふふっ！", "zh": "慢慢来没事的。时间还很充裕\n……毕竟我们现在还是新人嘛。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1017_null", "source_sha256": "45e95603b26e47df0f6139a7443a7c9df8861b14063e7a81ba2410f2b93126c0", "ja": "特典サイン＆握手会　1回目終了後……", "zh": "特典签名&握手会第1次结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "196d1a8a4e3f0cfea17ae7e9db2dd98fa9a333b1e268e66f436a1a5b485b3870", "ja": "美奈子、お疲れさま。さっきのお客さん、すっかり\n元気になったみたいだな。笑顔で帰ってくれたよ。", "zh": "美奈子，辛苦了。刚才那位客人好像已经完全打起精神来了。他笑着回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "03a83e24e2498029517abb288ca8c20991fffacde3f0856bc491250324f82524", "ja": "あ、あの顔色が真っ白だった人ですね。よかった～！\n最初はびっくりしましたけど……。", "zh": "啊，是那个脸色苍白的人吧。太好了～！一开始可吓了我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "17ef646716739c49f77e86b97ee42bc55340ad7b5084da871f6bea0bf6f81ae1", "ja": "あの人、手がすっごく震えてたんです。\nそれですぐわかりました。緊張してるんだって。", "zh": "那个人的手抖得特别厉害。\n所以我马上就看出来了，他是在紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "d95114174dca65c45e6fda5c937a590d93eeb206ac7145f0cf0b6df1e099da80", "ja": "すぐわかるのがすごいよな……。\nこういうイベント、美奈子も初めてなんだよな？", "zh": "你能马上看出来，真厉害啊……\n这种活动，美奈子也是第一次参加吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "508c2951cd9ec7e14603c58e04c7c6de8dedcc31cebbd2b629ca331cee4626ba", "ja": "もちろんです。でも、私もあの時気づいたんですけど\n……それってお客さんもじゃないですか？", "zh": "当然。不过，我也是在那时候才注意到的……观众不也一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "67924ebc703f3eb380d23de842bab0297b81525dd4e77fd963076f2f2e8e455c", "ja": "デビューしたばっかりで、ほとんど見たこともない\n私たちに、勇気を出して会いに来てくれて……。", "zh": "明明才刚出道，几乎都没见过我们，  \n却鼓起勇气来见我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "89fda7f26b1362bd57cfe7244750d678362abc8dd7e44a926290ed8f5787b4d0", "ja": "こんな嬉しいことってないですよね！　そう思ったら、\n絶対楽しい、嬉しい気持ちになってほしいって！", "zh": "没有比这更让人开心的事了！一想到这一点，就希望你一定能感受到快乐和喜悦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "08866321c38312370aa1149a1732d8a3f7fb37449e8c6f91deb1039c3e10a489", "ja": "あ、でも時間オーバーしちゃったんでしたっけ……。\n勝手なことしてごめんなさいっ！", "zh": "啊，不过确实超时了来着……。\n擅自做主，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "02f5ce549a5953b8808d0aefe01160b3cd26637ed4eb1e7c6fed48eff7bbd682", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。実際、時間はたっぷりあったしな！\n……むしろ、勉強させてもらったと思ってる。", "zh": "没事，没关系的。实际上时间也很充裕嘛！\n……不如说，我觉得自己反而学到了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "9a6ea680de628cf2a32317dc0b741140f2257f29fe48ae64209a22cb10baf24a", "ja": "え？　勉強って……\nプロデューサーさんがですか？", "zh": "诶？学习……是指制作人先生您吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "a10c71f23ac6a7e2fa094dee695930664305f632bc1312b7a238856bc324133b", "ja": "ああ。美奈子のそういう、目の前のひとりひとりを\n大切に思う気持ち、寄り添う気持ち……。", "zh": "是啊。美奈子那种珍惜眼前每一个人的心情，还有设身处地为他人着想的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "e87bd1b33abc2d9a83cae549b6629e9be917f65a97cb8ec8b5c41039b7861bac", "ja": "それって、アイドルにすごく大事なことで、\nたぶん俺も、忘れちゃいけないことだなって。", "zh": "那对偶像来说是非常重要的事，我想，大概也是我不能忘记的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "2b78120539c6bd2695ee1b79a48f70d9622364984e84540dbc5e873927f11a20", "ja": "そ、そんな……、大袈裟ですよ、もう～！\n私はただ……、みんなに元気になってほしいだけです。", "zh": "没、没那么夸张啦……真是的～！\n我只是……希望大家都能打起精神而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "d440ffd1c1023db1859495d0a9c8b038e9de211dca08b3930f449b6b9b4ac669", "ja": "あ！　だからプロデューサーさんも、\n元気が出ない時はいつでも言ってくださいね♪", "zh": "啊！所以制作人先生，\n打不起精神的时候随时都可以跟我说哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "774c34d64b936fda747192584616bf410b1039b09cfacd3b99e5b43a01f31d28", "ja": "ははっ、ありがとう。\n俺も励ましてくれるのか？", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢。\n你也会鼓励我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1033_019min", "source_sha256": "b591e23d81da2b7afca0b8bcffed0c2bc0483681defd43dc69c156774ce23d86", "ja": "いえ、ご飯を作ります！", "zh": "不，我是要给您做饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0302_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_04_1035_019min", "source_sha256": "09f63d7db6fb93749aceac81b5505d7800b91bdbcb594fa845afac1d2f6f0ae5", "ja": "元気が出ないのはお腹がすいてる証拠ですから！\n本当に呼んでくださいね？　ふふっ、約束ですよ♪", "zh": "打不起精神就说明肚子饿了！\n真的要叫我哦？呵呵，说好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
